  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Fish Our Future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Pacific Islands Regional):  .USAID will address the economic and governance drivers behind illegal, unreported, and unregulated (IUU) fishing, particularly in coastal fisheries. Funding will promote sub-regional cooperation and peer exchanges involving U.S. institutions and the private sector; establish monitoring, control, and surveillance systems for fisheries at the community and scale to provincial or state level; strengthen Pacific Island Countries&apos; enforcement capacity; forge new collaborations with U.S. government agencies and other development organizations to implement data-driven coastal enforcement plans; establish marine protected areas (MPA) and MPA networks; design improved and sustainable management programs; diversify economies of coastal communities; and collaborate with the private sector on promoting sustainable supply chains...Reducing IUU fishing will contribute to the Indo-Pacific Strategy by strengthening natural resource governance, combating transnational crime, and supporting maritime security. ...</narrative>
  </description>
